<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px;">You already have an account</h1>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>Someone just tried to register with this email address. It already has an account, so no new one was made.</p>
    <p>If it was you, <a href="{{appUrl}}">sign in</a> instead. Forgot your password? Use "Forgot password" on the sign-in page.</p>
    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">If it wasn't you, you can safely ignore this email. Your account hasn't changed.</p>
  </body>
</html>
